[h1]R.A.T.S. Rigging[/h1]
[i]R.A.T.S. – Reconnaissance, Acoustics, Terrain & Signals[/i]

[b]Just a code library: the code the R.A.T.S. mods share.[/b]
Not a mod to play. It adds nothing to the game by itself.

[quote]💬 [b]Questions, help, ideas[/b]: [url=https://discord.gg/CzuHd4f8Yf]R.A.T.S. Discord[/url]
▶ [b]Requires[/b]: [b]Keel[/b], the mod loader (Required items, top right)
✉ Bug reports: [url=https://hub.sewerlabs.dev/s/rigging]R.A.T.S. feedback board[/url][/quote]

[h2]▶ Quick start[/h2]
[list]
[*]Subscribe and switch it on in Mods. That is all
[*][b]Already have R.A.T.S. mods?[/b] Nothing is broken: they still run without it for now, a later update will need it
[/list]

